{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_07",
  "title": "黄金回廊",
  "storyCode": "SN-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9ff501339ec976dbdcb6e547639b714318ca831a56c31b45f1617fd0700cb8cf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我看见。\n我看见阿方索每天都要去大厅。大厅现在被他命名为伊比利亚。\n他把卧室里的镜子搬到了大厅去，他日复一日审视着自己。\n自大厨和小杰米被处决后，就只剩下我和他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我睡了多久？我睡的时间好少，我被迫清醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......不久......只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别勉强说话。我知道，你说话会痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "低级怪物的血还剩不少，用来写字吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我点了点头。角落里有桶，里面装满了猎物的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "时间太长了。我只睡了很短的时间，但我的梦似乎比这几十年时间还要漫长......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们应该放弃吗？小杰米和那个老厨子已经离开很久了，我们该随他们而去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我们应该放弃。\n我的意识越发模糊，就像梦醒前的纠缠。\n变化的不仅是肉体，是身为生物的所有部分。\n我们应该放弃。应该在被吞噬前结束自己。无止境的海面。海风。浪涛。呢喃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......大副，这是我们的船，是我们的理想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们迟早会无力行走，但它不会，“愚人号”不会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个雪茄成瘾的工程师说的没错，即使我们死光，这艘船也不会沉没。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天......只是漫长时间中的二十四小时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......（用恐鱼的血拼写单词的声音）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别......放弃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，你已经成了这副样子，我都看不见你碧蓝色的瞳孔，解脱对你来说不是更好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（书写）我是你的大副。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......为了......你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......别说话了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢，加西亚。无论你变成什么，我们的感情都不会变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但我知道，他在看镜子，是因为强壮如他，也终于败给了那些怪物。\n我们吞食血肉，起初，我们生火，后来，我们被迫生啖其肉。\n连最强大的审判官都曾对阿方索的力量赞叹不已，他曾被多少年轻的水手憧憬。他无所不能。\n可他撑了够久了，他也迟早会变成那些怪物。\n他在担忧。他在恼怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他连自己那丁点怪物的部分都容忍不了，他又怎么能容得下我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "垃圾。你甚至不如盐风城那株上岸的植物，那个女人根本就是在故弄玄虚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "海洋毫无变化可言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......Gla-dia......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我想见。你自由了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里有同胞。它受困。它需要帮助。它当回归族群怀抱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不少同胞，在这里死去。亲代不许。我必须救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "用你那副丑陋的嘴脸发声，并不能让人感到惊喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你回到大海。不必战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们一同——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经厌倦了你们的说辞，该了结你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......Gla-dia，你捕食我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "捕食我，会让你强大？会让你富有活力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "会让你脖颈上的鳞片生长蔓延，重回你原本模样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这节血肉，我斩断，你吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不够，我再给。我全给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂娅怔怔地看着地面上的血肉。\n她动摇了。\n她的动摇与海嗣无关，也与海嗣的行为无关。\n但只是这短暂的走神，便让海嗣断定，歌蕾蒂娅接受了它的提议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我们很快再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "海嗣离开，歌蕾蒂娅没有去追。\n因为歌蕾蒂娅嗅到了鲨鱼和斯卡蒂的气息。那只海嗣逃不走。\n歌蕾蒂娅回过头，看向气味传来的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......海的味道......血的味道，猎人的味道。在这艘船上？离这么近我才发现？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不可能......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们......我们该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "我没想过这里还有活人。我以为宰掉一些恐鱼，我们就能夺回这艘船。二队长说得挺简单的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......幽灵鲨，你在看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "镜子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道吗？斯卡蒂，哪怕此时此刻，我看着镜子里的自己，我也能想到很多被遗忘的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "晦暗的穹顶，百米高的雕塑，蓝晶色的歌剧院，冰晶倾泻的瀑布。那是哪里？斯卡蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......你的家乡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#13$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它......我记起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#13$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "扭曲的血肉爬满那座雕塑，它崩毁在一阵响动之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#13$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是......可是我记得那些事，但我却没经历过它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "不知道，你只说起过你以前住的地方，很久之前就沦陷了。比我认识你还久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "也许你是后来才在哪里看到的报道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们就不能一会再说吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在到底是去追那两个海嗣，还是趁他不在，直接抢夺这艘船，呃，开回去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#13$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不觉得这些幸存者花了六十年都做不到的事情，我们可以这么简单地做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "花点时间，队长会找到解决办法......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#6",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "幽灵鲨！你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有点......头晕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想起来了......他们对我做了什么。我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在格兰法洛见过她......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她愿意和我说话。她满足于伪善，她假情假意，可她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......她在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么......还有别的幸存者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "不，是敌人。有别的敌人潜上了这艘船，能跨越大海，已经足够说明他们的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "我们分头走，你去哪边？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我是伊比利亚的审判官，我肩负着确保这艘船回归伊比利亚的职责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我去追那个......阿方索！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（仓皇避开的窸窣声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎哈——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，别着急加西亚，我们很快就会追上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些不识趣的阿戈尔人打伤了它，它从维多利亚往上走，途经玻利瓦尔，只能去甲板，然后跳进海里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这艘船不是它想来就来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......莱塔尼亚。年轻的时候，我们曾与几位军官造访过那个国家，你还记得吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些选帝侯的嘴脸让人生厌。但他们懂得尊重艺术，这让我大受震撼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天是个好日子，我们见到了许多活人。虽然我希望她们赶紧滚蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去，去“莱塔尼亚”那里，加西亚。去弹奏你曾热爱的曲谱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为我的狩猎助兴吧，爱人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你，并非无鳞，你需要食物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（环绕的窸窣声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "营养，足够多。可这片海，还不完整。生物在白白死去，循环没有构建。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们尽快——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——为什么？捕食，无意义。我们有要做的事情，族群的任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是第十几只了？怪物。你们什么时候学会说话的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦......不对，我对你有印象，小家伙。在我们吃下你们父母的时候，你和你的兄弟姐妹们，就在一旁看着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你曾是它们中最弱小的那只，可怜的畜生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿方索笑着挑动海嗣的伤口，血液顺着刀尖落在地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们是血亲。你捕食我们，你成为我们。就像先前，我们的亲代捕食你，被你们捕食。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你们会因为某些条件变化，那有没有办法变得更好下咽？肉质方面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "捕食，为了生存。捕食，不分优劣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧，可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里......气味中断了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他把我引到这里，这个味道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂娅没有深究那个猎人的去向。\n她开始环顾四周。\n自上船开始，这些用材、装饰与技术就让人深感怀恋。\n布雷奥甘，科学院的天才，阿戈尔人。这里无疑是属于他的领域。\n数十年没有沉没的谜团，布雷奥甘想要向阿戈尔传递的信息，结合了源石与陆上技术的新产物。\n究竟是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂娅从怀中取出了钥匙。\n她开始打量四周。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "布雷奥甘......你把秘密藏在哪儿了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（这条船为什么要造得和宫殿一样？！而且大部分地方都是装饰性的，甚至还有雕塑......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不对，不止如此，这些雕塑和花纹地毯还被清洗过......这......在这个环境下？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "（远处传来音乐声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......钢琴声？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾丽妮放慢了脚步。\n走廊的尽头，她透过门扉的夹缝，看见了——\n——看见了一只海嗣，正在拍打一架几乎散架的钢琴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（是阿方索身旁的那个海嗣......！它为什么在这里？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（高兴地拍打着钢琴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，好吵......它根本就是在乱拍一气......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（那个阿方索不在这里......他去追击海嗣了？那为什么大副要独自在这里......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（先不管它好了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（刚才那段旋律，是偶然吗？看起来它只是在单纯地乱砸......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......它停下了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......海岸.....啊，海岸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "送别英雄......与......伟人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！嘶......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大副惊恐地转过头。惊恐。艾丽妮从它的举动中读出了惊恐。\n这是直面猎人时都没有过的、大幅度的、不知所措的身体行为。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你刚才，你不只是在拍打钢琴......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......刚才弹了一段，伊比利亚军歌......？你......为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你还有意识？难道你还有自己身为人的意识吗？你知道自己是谁吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，可是......你已经变成这样了，审判庭处置过类似的深海教徒，这是不可逆的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你要做什么？你的手要做什么！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小心地将手放在艾丽妮的头上）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......这是什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "透过婚纱似的帘布，被称作大副的海嗣注视着艾丽妮。\n它的瞳孔浑浊。它饱受煎熬。它——\n——满是慈爱和怀恋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你......你如果真的还留有作为人的意识......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么漫长的时间，你是怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——船、长——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎、怎么了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......捕食、捕食。你的行为并非捕食。你的目的在不断变化。动摇。对，动摇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你该接着弹你的琴，加西亚，你不该继续接触这些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（轻轻摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就咬住它，它的身体在变化。早点杀死它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们，不饿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿方索没有回答海嗣的问题，他只是像对待砧板上的肉一样，劈砍，劈砍。\n大副死死咬住海嗣，争斗中，它的冠冕跌落在地，它顾不上去拿。\n阿方索斩下了海嗣的触须。触须跌落在王冠旁。大副在一瞬间停下了动作。\n啊。加西亚，加西亚。\n看看你自己的王冠和那只触须，你现在清楚自己是什么模样了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......离开。我们再会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "加西亚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大副抬起头，海嗣已经不见踪影。\n它默默捡起王冠，戴在头上，回到阿方索的身边，轻蹭他的手，以示道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你受伤了吗，好大副？还是因为那几个不速之客，分神了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大副没有回答。\n它不敢说，它不敢说自己撕咬敌人的瞬间，感到自己在“撕咬同族”。\n它不敢说，再一次认识到自己如今的模样后，它开始心生愧疚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如果你心生任何情感，那是你还生而为人的证明。记住小杰米的最后一句话，“我既不悔恨，也不遗憾，也没有分毫恐惧。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你真的什么都感觉不到，你才失去了为人的资格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别在意，下次狩猎会很快的，它还会回来，一如既往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......（点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长阿方索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大副",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（轻轻摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......使者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......同胞。无鳞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您伤得很重，刚诞生的您，不该急着跳上这艘船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里有同胞，需要帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，没错。可是您受伤了。那些同胞不欢迎您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它们都尚未接纳自己的身份，它们还在迷茫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "身份？接纳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......您不需要理解。这片海还没有被完成，也许您需要更进一步地完善自身，才能引领整个种群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "时间。营养。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我来给您时间。我来为您准备营养。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那位不敬的船长猎杀恐鱼为食，却用尽手段阻隔蜕变，他窃取了循环的部分，却拒绝被纳入循环。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些子嗣的血肉都归属于您，您才是这些养分本该供给的对象。这艘船，延误了一个崭新生态的诞生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请不要拒绝我，使者。迟早，泰拉将会变成巢穴的代名词。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不拒绝。同胞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "时间。不用太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会回来。我们再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还以为你会冲上前来，杀了我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我该感谢你吗，乌尔比安？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那种东西，要杀就杀了。它现在甚至比昆图斯还弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你还真能忍耐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "歌蕾蒂娅在盐风城也曾委身于深海教会，打算套出些什么。当然，以她的性子，她不适合做这种事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我原以为你们都不适合。还是说，你比较特殊了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你对我说的话变多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。你的沉默真的没有规律可循吗，乌尔比安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别这么随意地直呼我的名字，黎博利。你不明白它的分量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们是敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你心底里已经不这么想了。哦，当然，你还是抱有“敌意”的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像饥肠辘辘的迷途旅人，在山间见到了受冻挨饿的裂兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "布雷奥甘留下的东西，满足你的想象了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还不够。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "海嗣的存在如果比阿戈尔还要古老，那么它们的历史被扭转，就一定有其原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们在乎神的话语，那就让你们在乎去。海嗣不是神，它们的父也不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我见过你们的神如何死亡，哀鸣穿过洋流，血肉布满深壑。族群盘旋在头顶，我坠向阿戈尔未知的领域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我亲眼所见。足以粉碎我过去建立起的所有信念，然后，我会去重建它，重新支撑起阿戈尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
